      "created_at": "2018-05-31T13:15:23Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-31T13:15:23Z",
      "body": "> [Lib/test/test_numeric_tower.py:184](https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Lib/test/test_numeric_tower.py#L184) in test_complex\r\n\r\nThe crash occurs at:\r\n\r\n```py\n    def test_complex(self):\r\n        # comparisons with complex are special:  equality and inequality\r\n        # comparisons should always succeed, but order comparisons should\r\n        # raise TypeError.\r\n        z = 1.0 + 0j\r\n        w = -3.14 + 2.7j\r\n\r\n        for v in 1, 1.0, F(1), D(1), complex(1):  # <~~ HERE\r\n            self.assertEqual(z, v)\r\n            self.assertEqual(v, z)\n```\n\r\n\r\nwhere F = fractions.Fraction and D = decimal.Decimal",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
