      "created_at": "2018-05-31T13:16:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-31T13:16:53Z",
      "body": "I bet that the bug comes from \\_decimal. Fraction is implemented in pure Python, and complex type is supposed to be simpler than the \\_decimal.Decimal type.\r\n\r\nThe whole mystery is why the bug only occurs in test_numeric_tower.test_complex() and why not in test_complex, test_fractions or test_decimal!? And why the bug is random.",
